+ * -- ENABLED PERMANENTLY for 7.77 images, with no new parameter ====
+ *
+ * Runbook: the project notes (gaps 7 and 3), consolidated:
+ * project notes par. 2. Two things the Apple host
+ * does on boot, and our driver does not:
+ *
+ *  (7) ZEROING the rest of TCM after the image copy. Kext _wlc_ol_up (0x73b78-0x73bc2,
+ *      re-host stage 1-2 trace v-olup2.txt): memset(TCM + ol+0x68 + ol+0x78, 0,
+ *      ol+0x90 - (ol+0x68 + ol+0x78)) -- from the end of the image (ol+0x78 = 0x6E324)
