+ *      [0x6E324, 0x9A080) = 179 548 B. TCM is not cleared by reboot, so without
+ *      this the fw 7.77 boots on garbage from the previous run. (Apple's first
+ *      memset -- memset(TCM + ol+0x60, 0, ol+0x68 - ol+0x60) -- is an empty
+ *      [0,0) range for 4360, so there is no point repeating it.)
