+ *      +0x20 (size) / +0x24 (text) pair in the host struct (writer items 8/9:
+ *      memmove(base+0x24, osh->vars, vars_size); base+0x20 = vars_size --
+ *      notes:1036-1045) and the fw 7.77 reads it
